<h3><u>achhe mere baba</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p>haaye kya aalame tanhaayi hai<br />
jab aakhri rukhsat ko chale sayyade waala<br />
kohraam tha dil hote the gham se taho baala<br />
shabbir ne godi se sakina ko utaara<br />
ghaazi ko kabhi akbar o qaasim ko pukaara<br />
baba ko qasam deke bulaati thi sakina<br />
sar pitti piche se chali jaati thi sakina</p>

<p>achhe mere baba haaye kya aalame tanhaayi hai<br />
achhe mere baba na sakina se chupaana<br />
kahin bhul na jaana<br />
dil rota hai kyun pehna hai malbus puraana<br />
kahin bhul na jaana</p>

<p>is tarha safar par koyi jaata nahi dekha<br />
pehne tumhe aisa kabhi kurta nahi dekha<br />
mein jaan gayi aaj hai maqtal me thikaana<br />
kahin bhul na jaana</p>

<p>sheh bole mein qurbaan meri jaan sakina<br />
ek waada hai jo aaj nibhaana hai sakina<br />
khaimon se nikal kar na hame dhundhne aana<br />
kahin bhul na jaana</p>

<p>kal raat se bechain the mein dekh rahi thi<br />
mein sine pe leti thi magar soyi kahaan thi<br />
ab samjhi tumhe ham se bohat dur hai jaana<br />
kahin bhul na jaana</p>

<p>aata hai nazar haal gharibi ka tumhaari<br />
lagta hai ye saamaan yatimi ka hamaari<br />
baba hame jine nahi dega ye zamaana<br />
kahin bhul na jaana</p>

<p>akbar kabhi asghar kabhi qaasim ne rulaaya<br />
jo ran ko gaya aaj palat kar nahi aaya<br />
bhuli nahi ab tak mein chacha jaan ka jaana<br />
kahin bhul na jaana</p>

<p>pehlu se shahe din ke na hatti thi sakina<br />
daaman kabhi qadmo se lipatti thi sakina<br />
tarhpaata hai ye aap ka daaman ko churhaana<br />
kahin bhul na jaana</p>

<p>ay sarwar o rehaan ye kehne lage sarwar<br />
ham bhi wahin jaate hai jahaan sote hain asghar<br />
beti phuphi ammaa ko na ro ro ke rulaana<br />
kahin bhul na jaana</p>
</p>